    "settings.general.bit_perfect.system_output": {
      "comment": "Settings, Audio pane: caption under the disabled bit-perfect output switch while the Output list's System Output row is selected. That row follows whatever device macOS is using rather than naming one, so the mode has no device to drive — even when the system's device is itself wired. Name the row exactly as 'menu.output.system' translates it, so it matches what the list shows. No trailing period.",
