    },
    "settings.general.declick": {
      "comment": "Settings, Audio pane: switch above Bit-perfect output. On, playback ramps the volume over the first and last few milliseconds of every start, stop, pause, seek and track change so the edge cannot click; off, it cuts, leaving every sample untouched. A short noun phrase for removing clicks.",
